    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Developer Overview – FOI RawRequest Processing\n\n**Purpose:**\nHandles the intake (raw request) stage of an FOI request: Intake team assignment, intake completion and reopen.\n\n**Trigger/Entry:**\nSub-workflow called by FOI Request Routing for intake events: `foi-intake-assignment`, `foi-intake-complete`, `foi-intake-reopen`.\n\n**Processing:**\n- Assignment: audit, then set the raw request status to \"Intake in Progress\".\n- Complete: audit, archive the raw request, then route on status. Open → audit and start FOI Request Processing with the list of ministries. Closed → audit only. Other statuses stop.\n- Reopen: audit only.\n\n**Integration/Outcome:**\nOpen requests start FOI Request Processing(async). Every step writes to `foi-process-audit`.",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 620,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "090e952c-91ff-412c-bbec-29d3f6a9cab8",
      "name": "Developer Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    }
